DOCUMENT();
loadMacros(
"PGstandard.pl",
"MathObjects.pl",
"PGML.pl"
);
Context("Numeric");

$fun_1 = Formula("(e^(x))-7");
$fun_2 = Formula("(x^3)+6");
$fun_3 = Formula("8-(ln(x))");
$fun_4 = Formula("cos((x^3))");
$fun_5 = Formula("(x/5)^2+4*(ln(x))+1");

BEGIN_PGML
# Questions:

_For arithmetic problems, if the result is not an integer, then retain *three significant digits*._

Given this function:

[`[$fun_1]`]

Compute:
- [`f''(x) =`] [_____]{$fun_1->D()->D()}
- [`f'(x) =`] [_____]{$fun_1->D()}
- [`f''(x) =`] [_____]{$fun_1->D()->D()}

---

Given this function:

[`[$fun_2]`]

Compute:
- [`f''(x) =`] [_____]{$fun_2->D()->D()}
- [`f''(x) =`] [_____]{$fun_2->D()->D()}

---

Given this function:

[`[$fun_3]`]

Compute:
- [`f''(x) =`] [_____]{$fun_3->D()->D()}

---

Given this function:

[`[$fun_4]`]

Compute:
- [`f'(x) =`] [_____]{$fun_4->D()}
- [`f'(8) =`] [_____]{$fun_4->D()->eval(x=>8)}

---

Given this function:

[`[$fun_5]`]

Compute:
- [`f'(x) =`] [_____]{$fun_5->D()}

---
END_PGML
ENDDOCUMENT();
